00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:07.600
decode disaggregation. Teams running large scale disaggregated inference should examine the topology

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:14.460
details. A complete colab notebook demonstrates building semantic hybrid, sparse, and quantized

